{"about_the_game":"This free DLC adds the Rennsteig to the heart of Germany as a new destination. A ridge walk and historical boundary path in the Thuringian Forest and Highland in Central Germany. <br>You can explore this new region all by yourself, or create new routes and transport passengers to the city of Oberhof or to the Treff Hotel Panorama.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937720/extras/Features.jpg?t=1674127620\" /><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Two new destinations with bus stops in Oberhof and at Treff Hotel Panorama<br></li><li>Beautiful recreated landscape in the dense Thuringian Forest<br></li><li>Treff Hotel Panorama with ski jumping hill<br></li><li>Ohra hydro dam<br></li><li>Forest operation, huts, raised hides and hay racks for wildlife await you<br></li><li>Winding roads and lots of resting areas<br></li><li>Especially lovely during the winter</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/937720?t=1674127620","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/937720?t=1674127620","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937720/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1674127620","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/937720/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1674127620","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"This free DLC adds the Rennsteig to the heart of Germany as a new destination. A ridge walk and historical boundary path in the Thuringian Forest and Highland in Central Germany. <br>You can explore this new region all by yourself, or create new routes and transport passengers to the city of Oberhof or to the Treff Hotel Panorama.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"htt